      "name": "The art of using t-SNE for single-cell transcriptomics",
      "citationKey": "kobakArtUsingTSNE2019",
      "url": "https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-019-13056-x",
      "sourceType": "application_paper",
      "authors": [
        "Dmitry Kobak",
