      "@type": "Resource",
      "name": "Examples are not Enough, Learn to Criticize! Criticism for Interpretability",
      "citationKey": "kimExamplesAreNot2016",
      "url": "https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper/2016/hash/5680522b8e2bb01943234bce7bf84534-Abstract.html",
