    {
      "@id": "tea:resource/ResampleResampleData",
      "@type": "Resource",
      "name": "resample: Resample data — fairmodels reference",
      "citationKey": "ResampleResampleData",
      "url": "https://modeloriented.github.io/fairmodels/reference/resample.html",
      "sourceType": "documentation",
      "abstract": "Method of bias mitigation. Similarly to reweight this method computes desired number of observations if the protected variable is independent\nfrom y and on this basis decides if this subgroup with certain class (+ or -) should be more or less numerous. Than performs oversampling or undersampling depending on the case.\nIf type of sampling is set to 'preferential' and probs are provided than instead of uniform sampling preferential sampling will be performed. Preferential sampling depending on the case\nwill sample observations close to border or far from border."
    },
